                            Complexity Analysis




                    Time Complexity: O(N2), Outer loop runs N times, and inner loop runs
                        up to N stars cumulatively.
                    Space Complexity: O(1), No extra space is used apart from loop counters.

Algorithm





                            We need to print a right-angled triangle where each row contains numbers starting from
                            1 up to the row number.
                            So, the first row has 1, the second row has 1 2, the third row has
                            1 2 3, and so on until N.



                            Use an outer loop (i) from 1 to N for rows.
                            For each row, use an inner loop (j) from 1 to i
                                to print numbers.
                            Each row prints numbers starting from 1 up to the current row index.
                            After printing each row, move to the next line.





