                            The goal is to print a pattern of alphabets where each row starts with a letter that is
                            progressively closer to 'A' as we move down.
                            The last column always has the letter 'A' + N - 1, and in each row, we print an
                            increasing sequence from a starting letter up to this last letter.




                            Loop through each row i from 0 to N-1.
