                                This pattern prints two symmetrical right-angled triangles facing each other with spaces
                                in between.
                                - In the first half, stars increase while spaces decrease.
                                - In the second half, stars decrease while spaces increase.
                                The symmetry is maintained across the middle row.




                                Initialize spaces = 2 * n - 2.
                                Run an outer loop from 1 to 2*n - 1 (total rows).
