Optimised Approach.description:
Algorithm







Intuition
Two important properties of XOR are the following:
XOR of two same numbers is always 0 i.e. a ^ a = 0. ←Property 1.
XOR of a number with 0 will result in the number itself i.e. 0 ^ a = a.  ←Property 2

Approach
   We will just perform the XOR of all elements of the array using a loop and the final XOR will be the answer.





        Code



    C++JavaPythonJavaScript123456789101112131415161718192021222324252627282930#include <bits/stdc++.h>
