                    Time Complexity: O(2 × max(length of list1, length of list2)) + O(abs(length of list1 −
                            length of list2)) + O(min(length of list1, length of list2)), Finding the length of
                        both lists takes O(max) time since it's done simultaneously, then moving one pointer by the
