                    Time Complexity: O(2N), where N is the number of nodes in the linked list. The
                        linked list is traversed twice, once for creating copies of each node and for the second time to
                        set the next and random pointers for each copied node. The time to access the nodes in the map
                        is O(1) due to hashing.

