                            Complexity Analysis








Time Complexity: O(2^N),In the worst case (all unique elements), we generate all possible subsets, which is 2^N. Sorting takes O(N log N), so total complexity is O(2^N + N log N) ≈ O(2^N). Space Complexity: O(N) ,Due to recursion depth and storage of the current subset in the call stack. The output storage is O(2^N) for all subsets.

