                            Complexity Analysis








Time Complexity: O(n), where n is the number of elements in the array. We only iterate through the non-leaf nodes, which are at most n/2, so it's still O(n) in terms of asymptotic complexity. Each comparison (at most two per node) is constant time. Space Complexity: O(1), no extra space is used. We only use a few variables.

