                Time Complexity: O(V + E) + O(N log N),

                    O(V + E) for performing BFS on the graph (where V = number of
                        vertices/nodes, E = number of edges).
                    O(N log N) for sorting the safeNodes array (where N is
                        the number of safe nodes).


                Space Complexity: O(3N) ~ O(N),

